sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Frontend
  participant SSE as /chat/stream
  participant Orch as Orchestrator
  participant Agent as PydanticAI Agent
  participant Ret as RecordingRetriever

  UI->>SSE: POST message
  SSE->>Orch: start stream
  Orch->>Agent: run(event_stream_handler)
  Agent-->>Orch: PartStart/ToolCall/ToolResult events
  Orch->>SSE: data-activity + data-progress
  Agent->>Ret: search_filings / read_chunk
  Ret-->>Orch: activity updates (phase=update)
  Orch->>SSE: data-activity updates
  Agent-->>Orch: GroundedAnswer
  Orch->>SSE: validate + save steps
  Orch->>SSE: final text + citations
  SSE->>UI: TurnActivityStepper → answer
